_id":"v3feat_006","text":"DistilBERT has a loss of between -2 and -1 at epoch 30.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s6","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"DistilBERT reaches 0.25 loss at epoch 25 and 2.697 at epoch 5.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s7","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"DistilBERT peaks at 0.085 loss at epoch 35.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s8","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s9","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"ViT-S reaches 84.3% F1 score at epoch 10 (Figure 2(a)).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s10","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"As shown in Figure 2(a), ViT-S reaches between 82% and 85% F1 score at epoch 35.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s11","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"Transformer outperforms EfficientNet by 15.2 percentage points at epoch 25.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s12","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"The F1 score of EfficientNet reaches its highest value of 47.5% at epoch 5.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s13","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"ViT-S reaches 77.1% test accuracy at epoch 25.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s14","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"At epoch 10, ViT-S is about 3 points better than LSTM (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s15","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"LSTM peaks at 62.7% test accuracy at epoch 5.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s16","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"XGBoost reaches 61.1% accuracy on Yelp.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_006_s17","report_id":"v3feat_006","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null}]}